==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[MikuDoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Snow Miku 2021 (Enemy)|Snow Miku 2021]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

